FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Comme j'étais dans l'coin, j'me suis
dit qu'j'allais passer t'faire coucou,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Non sono qui per un motivo preciso.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ero da queste parti e ho deciso di
fare un salto da te. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, don't worry 'bout tea and stuff!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}No need to get all formal. It's just
you and me! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ach,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mach dir jetzt keinen Stress
wegen Gastgeberpflichten und so!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
Sind doch unter uns!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Çay may uğraşma sakın!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bu kadar resmiyete gerek yok.
Şurada ikimiz bize bizeyiz! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Passeggiavo e sono arrivata qui!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Comunque è assurdo... È proprio
{{TAG:0005:001E:00CD}} là fuori!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Huy, es verdad! Te he traído
una cosilla. {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Toma, ¡{{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, so I brought you something!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Just a little {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
for you to munch on if you want.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Huy, que yo te había traído una
cosilla!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}No es más que {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}, ¡ji, ji!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa, sana bir şey getirdim!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Canın isterse atıştırırsın diye
küçük bir {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Huy, vaya! Creo que me tengo
que ir marchando a la de ya.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Pero me lo he pasado pipa!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hai delle cose da fare là fuori?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Anche io devo smammare. Grazie
per l'ospitalità, eh? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
